{
  "id": "g3",
  "title": "G3 · Audio paper track",
  "summary": "A paper-focused path to mastery of the Davis–Kahan journal paper: subspace geometry and direct rotations, spectral subspaces and residuals, unitarily invariant norms and operator ideals, Sylvester estimates, the sine-theta theorem, the tangent and double-angle theorems, and the Section 4 transport results through the Proposition 4.4 counterexample and real matching. Being rewritten lecture by lecture; see PAPER_COVERAGE_PLAN.md.",
